{"track":"act","num":"8.01","title":"Matrices, Vectors & Complex Numbers","sections":[{"heading":"Matrix arithmetic","questions":[{"q":"Matrix $A$ has rows $(2,3)$ and $(-1,4)$; matrix $B$ has rows $(5,-2)$ and $(1,3)$. Find the rows of $A+B$.","answer":"Adding corresponding entries: first row $(2+5,\\,3+(-2))=(7,1)$; second row $(-1+1,\\,4+3)=(0,7)$."},{"q":"Find $3A$ for matrix $A$ with rows $(1,-2)$ and $(4,0)$.","answer":"Multiply every entry by 3: rows $(3,-6)$ and $(12,0)$."}]},{"heading":"Matrix multiplication","questions":[{"q":"Matrix $A$ has rows $(1,2)$ and $(3,4)$; matrix $B$ has rows $(5,6)$ and $(7,8)$. Find $AB$.","answer":"Row 1 of $AB$: $(1(5)+2(7),\\ 1(6)+2(8))=(19,22)$. Row 2 of $AB$: $(3(5)+4(7),\\ 3(6)+4(8))=(43,50)$."}]},{"heading":"Determinants and inverses of 2×2 matrices","questions":[{"q":"Find the determinant of the matrix with rows $(4,2)$ and $(3,5)$.","answer":"$\\det=4(5)-2(3)=20-6=14$."},{"q":"Find the inverse of the matrix $M$ with rows $(2,1)$ and $(5,3)$.","answer":"$\\det(M)=2(3)-1(5)=1$. $M^{-1}=\\dfrac{1}{1}\\times$ the matrix with rows $(3,-1)$ and $(-5,2)$, giving $M^{-1}$ with rows $(3,-1)$ and $(-5,2)$."}]},{"heading":"Vectors: magnitude and direction","questions":[{"q":"Find the magnitude of the vector $\\mathbf{v}=(3,4)$.","answer":"$|\\mathbf{v}|=\\sqrt{3^2+4^2}=\\sqrt{9+16}=\\sqrt{25}=5$.","figure":{"type":"plot","points":[[3,4]],"xmin":-1,"xmax":5,"ymin":-1,"ymax":5,"width":190}},{"q":"Given $\\mathbf{a}=(2,-5)$ and $\\mathbf{b}=(-3,7)$, find $\\mathbf{a}+\\mathbf{b}$ and $2\\mathbf{a}-\\mathbf{b}$.","answer":"$\\mathbf{a}+\\mathbf{b}=(2-3,\\,-5+7)=(-1,2)$. $2\\mathbf{a}-\\mathbf{b}=(4-(-3),\\,-10-7)=(7,-17)$.","figure":{"type":"plot","points":[[2,-5],[-3,7]],"xmin":-5,"xmax":4,"ymin":-7,"ymax":9,"width":200}}]},{"heading":"The dot product","questions":[{"q":"Find $\\mathbf{a}\\cdot\\mathbf{b}$ for $\\mathbf{a}=(3,2)$ and $\\mathbf{b}=(-1,4)$, and determine whether the vectors are perpendicular.","answer":"$\\mathbf{a}\\cdot\\mathbf{b}=3(-1)+2(4)=-3+8=5$. Since $\\mathbf{a}\\cdot\\mathbf{b}\\neq0$, the vectors are not perpendicular.","figure":{"type":"plot","points":[[3,2],[-1,4]],"xmin":-3,"xmax":5,"ymin":-1,"ymax":6,"width":190}}]},{"heading":"Complex number arithmetic","questions":[{"q":"Simplify $(4+3i)+(2-5i)$.","answer":"$(4+2)+(3-5)i=6-2i$.","figure":{"type":"plot","points":[[4,3],[2,-5]],"xmin":-2,"xmax":6,"ymin":-7,"ymax":5,"width":190}},{"q":"Simplify $(3+2i)(1-4i)$.","answer":"$(3+2i)(1-4i)=3-12i+2i-8i^2=3-10i+8=11-10i$ (using $i^2=-1$).","figure":{"type":"plot","points":[[3,2],[1,-4]],"xmin":-1,"xmax":5,"ymin":-6,"ymax":4,"width":190}}]},{"heading":"Complex conjugates and division","questions":[{"q":"Find the complex conjugate of $z=6-5i$, and compute $z\\bar{z}$.","answer":"$\\bar{z}=6+5i$. $z\\bar{z}=(6-5i)(6+5i)=36-25i^2=36+25=61$.","figure":{"type":"plot","points":[[6,-5]],"xmin":-8,"xmax":8,"ymin":-8,"ymax":8,"width":190}},{"q":"Simplify $\\dfrac{5+i}{2-i}$ by multiplying by the conjugate of the denominator.","answer":"$\\dfrac{5+i}{2-i}\\cdot\\dfrac{2+i}{2+i}=\\dfrac{(5+i)(2+i)}{4+1}=\\dfrac{10+5i+2i+i^2}{5}=\\dfrac{10+7i-1}{5}=\\dfrac{9+7i}{5}=\\dfrac{9}{5}+\\dfrac{7}{5}i$.","figure":{"type":"plot","points":[[5,1],[2,-1]],"xmin":-1,"xmax":7,"ymin":-3,"ymax":3,"width":190}}]},{"heading":"Solving quadratics with complex solutions","questions":[{"q":"Solve $x^2+2x+5=0$, giving your answer in the form $a+bi$.","answer":"Using the quadratic formula: $x=\\dfrac{-2\\pm\\sqrt{4-20}}{2}=\\dfrac{-2\\pm\\sqrt{-16}}{2}=\\dfrac{-2\\pm4i}{2}=-1\\pm2i$.","figure":{"type":"plot","fns":["x**2+2*x+5"],"xmin":-5,"xmax":3,"ymin":-2,"ymax":15,"width":200}}]},{"heading":"Combining matrices and systems of equations","questions":[{"q":"This question has two parts. The system $3x+2y=16$ and $x+4y=18$ can be written as a matrix equation $M\\mathbf{v}=\\mathbf{c}$, where $M$ has rows $(3,2)$ and $(1,4)$. (a) Find $\\det(M)$ and $M^{-1}$. (b) Use $M^{-1}$ to solve the system for $x$ and $y$.","answer":"(a) $\\det(M)=3(4)-2(1)=10$. $M^{-1}=\\dfrac{1}{10}\\times$ the matrix with rows $(4,-2)$ and $(-1,3)$, giving rows $(0.4,-0.2)$ and $(-0.1,0.3)$. (b) Applying $M^{-1}$ to $(16,18)^T$: $x=0.4(16)-0.2(18)=6.4-3.6=2.8$. $y=-0.1(16)+0.3(18)=-1.6+5.4=3.8$.","figure":{"type":"plot","fns":["(16-3*x)/2","(18-x)/4"],"xmin":-2,"xmax":10,"ymin":-2,"ymax":10,"width":220}}]},{"heading":"Powers of $i$ and simplifying complex expressions","questions":[{"q":"Simplify $i^{17}$, using the fact that powers of $i$ cycle with period 4.","answer":"$17=4(4)+1$, so $i^{17}=(i^4)^4\\cdot i^1=1^4\\cdot i=i$.","figure":{"type":"circle","radius":1,"points":[{"angle":0,"label":"i⁰=1"},{"angle":90,"label":"i¹=i"},{"angle":180,"label":"i²=-1"},{"angle":270,"label":"i³=-i"}],"width":170}},{"q":"Simplify $(2i)^3$.","answer":"$(2i)^3=8i^3=8(i^2\\cdot i)=8(-1\\cdot i)=-8i$."}]},{"heading":"Vector direction and unit vectors","questions":[{"q":"Find a unit vector in the same direction as $\\mathbf{v}=(6,-8)$.","answer":"$|\\mathbf{v}|=\\sqrt{36+64}=\\sqrt{100}=10$. Unit vector: $\\dfrac{1}{10}(6,-8)=(0.6,-0.8)$.","figure":{"type":"plot","points":[[6,-8]],"xmin":-2,"xmax":8,"ymin":-10,"ymax":2,"width":190}},{"q":"Find the angle a vector $\\mathbf{v}=(3,3)$ makes with the positive $x$-axis.","answer":"$\\theta=\\arctan\\left(\\dfrac{3}{3}\\right)=\\arctan(1)=45^\\circ$.","figure":{"type":"plot","points":[[3,3]],"xmin":-1,"xmax":5,"ymin":-1,"ymax":5,"width":180}}]},{"heading":"Identity matrix and matrix equations","questions":[{"q":"Explain why $MI=M$ for any matrix $M$ and identity matrix $I$ of matching size, and verify this for $M$ with rows $(2,3)$ and $(1,4)$ multiplied by the $2\\times2$ identity matrix (rows $(1,0)$ and $(0,1)$).","answer":"The identity matrix leaves any matrix unchanged under multiplication, just as the number 1 does in ordinary multiplication. Verifying: row 1 of $MI$: $(2(1)+3(0),\\ 2(0)+3(1))=(2,3)$; row 2: $(1(1)+4(0),\\ 1(0)+4(1))=(1,4)$ — identical to $M$'s original rows, confirming $MI=M$."}]},{"heading":"A multi-part complex number problem","questions":[{"q":"This question has two parts. Given $z_1=3+4i$ and $z_2=1-2i$. (a) Find $|z_1|$ (the modulus of $z_1$). (b) Find $z_1\\cdot z_2$ and its modulus, then verify that $|z_1\\cdot z_2|=|z_1|\\cdot|z_2|$.","answer":"(a) $|z_1|=\\sqrt{3^2+4^2}=\\sqrt{25}=5$. (b) $z_1z_2=(3+4i)(1-2i)=3-6i+4i-8i^2=3-2i+8=11-2i$. $|z_1z_2|=\\sqrt{11^2+2^2}=\\sqrt{121+4}=\\sqrt{125}=5\\sqrt{5}$. $|z_2|=\\sqrt{1^2+(-2)^2}=\\sqrt{5}$. Check: $|z_1|\\cdot|z_2|=5\\sqrt{5}$, matching $|z_1z_2|=5\\sqrt{5}$ ✓.","figure":{"type":"plot","points":[[3,4],[1,-2]],"xmin":-1,"xmax":5,"ymin":-4,"ymax":6,"width":190}}]},{"heading":"Scalar multiplication of matrices and vectors combined","questions":[{"q":"Given vectors $\\mathbf{u}=(4,-3)$ and $\\mathbf{v}=(-2,5)$, find $3\\mathbf{u}-2\\mathbf{v}$.","answer":"$3\\mathbf{u}=(12,-9)$. $2\\mathbf{v}=(-4,10)$. $3\\mathbf{u}-2\\mathbf{v}=(12-(-4),\\,-9-10)=(16,-19)$.","figure":{"type":"plot","points":[[4,-3],[-2,5]],"xmin":-4,"xmax":6,"ymin":-5,"ymax":7,"width":190}}]},{"heading":"Multiple choice — easy","questions":[{"q":"Simplify $(10)+(4-2i)$.","choices":["$14$","$-14-2i$","$14-2i$","$16-2i$"],"correct":2,"answer":"$(10+4)+(0-2)i=14-2i$."},{"q":"Simplify $(-10+6i)-(7+11i)$.","choices":["$-17-5i$","$-17-3i$","$-15-5i$","$17-5i$"],"correct":0,"answer":"$(-10-7)+(6-11)i=-17-5i$."},{"q":"Simplify $(3+9i)+(11+9i)$.","choices":["$-14+18i$","$14+20i$","$16+18i$","$14+18i$"],"correct":3,"answer":"$(3+11)+(9+9)i=14+18i$."},{"q":"Simplify $(2-9i)-(1+7i)$.","choices":["$3-16i$","$1-16i$","$-1-16i$","$1-14i$"],"correct":1,"answer":"$(2-1)+(-9-7)i=1-16i$."},{"q":"Simplify $(6-10i)+(-9+8i)$.","choices":["$-1-2i$","$3-2i$","$-3-2i$","$-3$"],"correct":2,"answer":"$(6-9)+(-10+8)i=-3-2i$."},{"q":"Simplify $(-4+8i)-(-10-3i)$.","choices":["$8+11i$","$6+11i$","$-6+11i$","$6+13i$"],"correct":1,"answer":"$(-4+10)+(8+3)i=6+11i$."},{"q":"Simplify $(-5+5i)-(9-10i)$.","choices":["$-14+17i$","$-14+15i$","$-12+15i$","$14+15i$"],"correct":1,"answer":"$(-5-9)+(5+10)i=-14+15i$."},{"q":"Simplify $(1-12i)+(8+5i)$.","choices":["$11-7i$","$-9-7i$","$9-7i$","$9-5i$"],"correct":2,"answer":"$(1+8)+(-12+5)i=9-7i$."},{"q":"Simplify $(-9-12i)-(-12i)$.","choices":["$-7$","$-9+2i$","$-9$","$9$"],"correct":2,"answer":"$(-9)+(-12+12)i=-9$."},{"q":"Simplify $(-1+3i)-(11+5i)$.","choices":["$-10-2i$","$-12$","$12-2i$","$-12-2i$"],"correct":3,"answer":"$(-1-11)+(3-5)i=-12-2i$."},{"q":"Simplify $(12-6i)+(-3+5i)$.","choices":["$9-i$","$9+i$","$11-i$","$-9-i$"],"correct":0,"answer":"$(12-3)+(-6+5)i=9-i$."},{"q":"Simplify $(-11+12i)+(8+11i)$.","choices":["$3+23i$","$-3+25i$","$-1+23i$","$-3+23i$"],"correct":3,"answer":"$(-11+8)+(12+11)i=-3+23i$."},{"q":"Simplify $(-8+10i)+(-9i)$.","choices":["$-8+i$","$-8+3i$","$-6+i$","$8+i$"],"correct":0,"answer":"$(-8)+(10-9)i=-8+i$."},{"q":"Simplify $(2-i)+(-7+4i)$.","choices":["$5+3i$","$-5+5i$","$-3+3i$","$-5+3i$"],"correct":3,"answer":"$(2-7)+(-1+4)i=-5+3i$."},{"q":"Simplify $(-12i)+(3-6i)$.","choices":["$-3-18i$","$5-18i$","$3-16i$","$3-18i$"],"correct":3,"answer":"$(0+3)+(-12-6)i=3-18i$."}]},{"heading":"Multiple choice — medium","questions":[{"q":"Simplify $(2-7i)(3-9i)$.","choices":["$-57-39i$","$-55-39i$","$69-39i$","$-57+3i$"],"correct":0,"answer":"$(2-7i)(3-9i)=6-21i-18i+63i^2=6-39i-63=-57-39i$."},{"q":"Simplify $(-4-4i)(8-9i)$.","choices":["$-66+4i$","$4+4i$","$-68+4i$","$-68+68i$"],"correct":2,"answer":"$(-4-4i)(8-9i)=-32-32i+36i+36i^2=-32+4i-36=-68+4i$."},{"q":"Simplify $(-4+2i)(7-9i)$.","choices":["$-46+50i$","$-10+22i$","$-10+50i$","$-8+50i$"],"correct":2,"answer":"$(-4+2i)(7-9i)=-28+14i+36i-18i^2=-28+50i+18=-10+50i$."},{"q":"Simplify $(7+i)(7+9i)$.","choices":["$42+70i$","$40+70i$","$40+56i$","$58+70i$"],"correct":1,"answer":"$(7+i)(7+9i)=49+7i+63i+9i^2=49+70i-9=40+70i$."},{"q":"Simplify $(-3+i)(-2-3i)$.","choices":["$11+7i$","$9+11i$","$9+7i$","$3+7i$"],"correct":2,"answer":"$(-3+i)(-2-3i)=6-2i+9i-3i^2=6+7i+3=9+7i$."},{"q":"Simplify $(3+7i)(-5-6i)$.","choices":["$27+17i$","$27-53i$","$-57-53i$","$29-53i$"],"correct":1,"answer":"$(3+7i)(-5-6i)=-15-35i-18i-42i^2=-15-53i+42=27-53i$."},{"q":"Simplify $(5i)(2+2i)$.","choices":["$10+10i$","$-10-10i$","$-10+10i$","$-8+10i$"],"correct":2,"answer":"$(5i)(2+2i)=0+10i+10i^2=0+10i-10=-10+10i$."},{"q":"Simplify $(-5+3i)(9+6i)$.","choices":["$-27-3i$","$-61-3i$","$-63-57i$","$-63-3i$"],"correct":3,"answer":"$(-5+3i)(9+6i)=-45+27i-30i+18i^2=-45-3i-18=-63-3i$."},{"q":"Simplify $(2-7i)(-7-5i)$.","choices":["$-47+39i$","$21+39i$","$-49+39i$","$-49-59i$"],"correct":2,"answer":"$(2-7i)(-7-5i)=-14+49i-10i+35i^2=-14+39i-35=-49+39i$."},{"q":"Simplify $(2-3i)(3+3i)$.","choices":["$15+15i$","$15-3i$","$17-3i$","$-3-3i$"],"correct":1,"answer":"$(2-3i)(3+3i)=6-9i+6i-9i^2=6-3i+9=15-3i$."},{"q":"Simplify $(8-2i)(-6-4i)$.","choices":["$-54-20i$","$-56-20i$","$-40-20i$","$-56-44i$"],"correct":1,"answer":"$(8-2i)(-6-4i)=-48+12i-32i+8i^2=-48-20i-8=-56-20i$."},{"q":"Simplify $(6+3i)(8-6i)$.","choices":["$66-60i$","$66-12i$","$30-12i$","$68-12i$"],"correct":1,"answer":"$(6+3i)(8-6i)=48+24i-36i-18i^2=48-12i+18=66-12i$."},{"q":"Simplify $(-3+6i)(4-2i)$.","choices":["$30i$","$-24+30i$","$2+30i$","$-18i$"],"correct":0,"answer":"$(-3+6i)(4-2i)=-12+24i+6i-12i^2=-12+30i+12=30i$."},{"q":"Simplify $(-8+4i)(-2-9i)$.","choices":["$-20+64i$","$54+64i$","$52+64i$","$52+80i$"],"correct":2,"answer":"$(-8+4i)(-2-9i)=16-8i+72i-36i^2=16+64i+36=52+64i$."},{"q":"Simplify $(-6+8i)(-7+9i)$.","choices":["$-28-110i$","$-30+2i$","$-30-110i$","$114-110i$"],"correct":2,"answer":"$(-6+8i)(-7+9i)=42-56i-54i+72i^2=42-110i-72=-30-110i$."}]},{"heading":"Multiple choice — hard","questions":[{"q":"Find the determinant of the matrix with rows $(4,2)$ and $(3,1)$.","choices":["$-4$","$0$","$-2$","$10$"],"correct":2,"answer":"$\\det=(4)(1)-(2)(3)=4-6=-2$."},{"q":"Find the determinant of the matrix with rows $(-4,5)$ and $(7,-5)$.","choices":["$-13$","$-17$","$-3$","$-15$"],"correct":3,"answer":"$\\det=(-4)(-5)-(5)(7)=20-35=-15$."},{"q":"Find the determinant of the matrix with rows $(-1,-7)$ and $(-2,4)$.","choices":["$-20$","$-18$","$30$","$-16$"],"correct":1,"answer":"$\\det=(-1)(4)-(-7)(-2)=-4-14=-18$."},{"q":"Find the determinant of the matrix with rows $(-8,-9)$ and $(9,8)$.","choices":["$17$","$15$","$19$","$0$"],"correct":0,"answer":"$\\det=(-8)(8)-(-9)(9)=-64+81=17$."},{"q":"Find the determinant of the matrix with rows $(-7,6)$ and $(8,6)$.","choices":["$-92$","$-88$","$-90$","$-86$"],"correct":2,"answer":"$\\det=(-7)(6)-(6)(8)=-42-48=-90$."},{"q":"Find the magnitude of the vector $\\mathbf{v}=(6,8)$.","choices":["$10$","$14$","$9$","$11$"],"correct":0,"answer":"$|\\mathbf{v}|=\\sqrt{(6)^2+(8)^2}=\\sqrt{36+64}=\\sqrt{100}=10$."},{"q":"Find the magnitude of the vector $\\mathbf{v}=(20,21)$.","choices":["$29$","$41$","$30$","$28$"],"correct":0,"answer":"$|\\mathbf{v}|=\\sqrt{(20)^2+(21)^2}=\\sqrt{400+441}=\\sqrt{841}=29$."},{"q":"Find the magnitude of the vector $\\mathbf{v}=(-3,4)$.","choices":["$4$","$7$","$5$","$6$"],"correct":2,"answer":"$|\\mathbf{v}|=\\sqrt{(-3)^2+(4)^2}=\\sqrt{9+16}=\\sqrt{25}=5$."},{"q":"Find the magnitude of the vector $\\mathbf{v}=(20,-21)$.","choices":["$28$","$29$","$41$","$30$"],"correct":1,"answer":"$|\\mathbf{v}|=\\sqrt{(20)^2+(-21)^2}=\\sqrt{400+441}=\\sqrt{841}=29$."},{"q":"Find the magnitude of the vector $\\mathbf{v}=(-7,-24)$.","choices":["$26$","$24$","$25$","$31$"],"correct":2,"answer":"$|\\mathbf{v}|=\\sqrt{(-7)^2+(-24)^2}=\\sqrt{49+576}=\\sqrt{625}=25$."},{"q":"Simplify $i^{16}$, using the fact that powers of $i$ cycle with period 4.","choices":["$i$","$-i$","$1$","$-1$"],"correct":2,"answer":"$16=4(4)$, so $i^{16}=(i^4)^{4}=1^{4}=1$."},{"q":"Simplify $i^{36}$, using the fact that powers of $i$ cycle with period 4.","choices":["$1$","$-i$","$i$","$-1$"],"correct":0,"answer":"$36=4(9)$, so $i^{36}=(i^4)^{9}=1^{9}=1$."},{"q":"Simplify $i^{5}$, using the fact that powers of $i$ cycle with period 4.","choices":["$-1$","$1$","$-i$","$i$"],"correct":3,"answer":"$5=4(1)+1$, so $i^{5}=(i^4)^{1}\\cdot i^{1}=1^{1}\\cdot i^{1}=i$."},{"q":"Simplify $i^{40}$, using the fact that powers of $i$ cycle with period 4.","choices":["$-1$","$i$","$-i$","$1$"],"correct":3,"answer":"$40=4(10)$, so $i^{40}=(i^4)^{10}=1^{10}=1$."},{"q":"Simplify $i^{34}$, using the fact that powers of $i$ cycle with period 4.","choices":["$1$","$-i$","$i$","$-1$"],"correct":3,"answer":"$34=4(8)+2$, so $i^{34}=(i^4)^{8}\\cdot i^{2}=1^{8}\\cdot i^{2}=-1$."}]}]}